{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36917","headline":"扇上画牡丹 · 罗隐","name":"扇上画牡丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲爱红芳满砌堦，教人扇上画将来。\n叶随彩笔参差长，花逐轻风吹第开。\n闲挂几曾停蛱蜨，频摇不怕落莓苔。\n根生无地如仙桂，疑是姮娥月里栽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36917.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36917","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}